WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.960
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.470
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:47.180
<i>If only, time like this
would go on forever...</i>

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:05.160
"A Declaration of War!"

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.800
Oh, you bought that Buittan bag?

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:11.700
Uh-hm... But it cost less
than 100,000 yen.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:14.740
I've been trying to get my dad
to buy me a Shanel watch.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.810
I envy you...

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.480
Just two more years...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.680
Just hang on for two more years.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:30.590
<i>I want my school life here
to be peaceful and quiet.</i>

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.990
<i>That's all I ask for.</i>

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.840
Hey... How dirty!
You got dust on my pants.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:56.380
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...
Forgive me...

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.220
Not again...

00:03:58.880 --> 00:03:59.720
Tsukushi...

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.160
If an apology was good enough,
we wouldn't need the police.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.860
<i>I knew it. It's the F4!</i>

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.400
Dust it off, will you?

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.870
<i>Eitoku Academy's gang of four,
made up of sons of the richest families.</i>

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:22.440
<i>And they're the source of
the bullying at this school.</i>

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.710
The F4... so cool...

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.380
He's done for...

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.630
Ya...!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.460
Hoo...

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.700
Yahoo!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.440
I can't believe this!

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:53.440
Domyoji, look at the mess
you've made.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.110
<i>It's just a little dust
on his pants.</i>

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.980
<i>We were just cleaning
like we were supposed to.</i>

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.460
Rui, leave it alone. Let's go.

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:19.930
Rui... Hanazawa...
What was that all about?

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.370
His eyes were like marbles.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:33.980
That boy was lucky
to get off so easily.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.020
He might have been made
the target of everyone's bullying.

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.120
Yeah...

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:51.230
Hey, we're friends, aren't we?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.030
Why all the sudden?

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:57.140
When things like that happen,
I get worried...

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:01.640
that maybe I don't have any
real friends at this school.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:05.940
When someone's being bullied,

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:08.450
everyone either joins in
or turns the other way.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.450
Of course, I'm one of them.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.350
I'm no different...

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:19.360
I sometimes think I'm the only one
who thinks we are friends.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:22.960
Makiko...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.300
That's not true.
I think of you as a friend, too.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.300
Really?

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.740
Yes.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:39.440
Tsukushi!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.550
<i>What shall I do? I'm so moved.</i>

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:48.120
<i>I was thinking
the same thing myself.</i>

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.760
Say, I found a shop that
serves delicious cakes.

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:55.030
You want to stop by?

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.630
Oh, Maki... the stairs!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.160
Maki!

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:13.210
Ohh... My butt...

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:16.320
Tsukushi, will you pull me up?

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.390
M-Maki... behind you...

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.120
Huh? Behind me?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.490
Move!

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.040
That hurt.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:38.070
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.270
You okay, Tsukasa?

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:41.940
No, I'm not!

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.180
I'm sorry... Forgive me!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.280
You've got some nerve.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:48.850
It wasn't on purpose...

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:53.520
That's enough. You know
what to expect.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:58.290
Wait a minute!
She apologized, didn't she?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.290
Please forgive her.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:06.970
Is this an example of cheap
middle-class friendship?

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:20.450
That does it! You fish-tyrant!

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.180
<i>Fish-tyrant?</i>

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.850
I combined "big fish in a small pond"

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.790
with "the tyrant on his little hill."

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:29.350
That's just for you, F4!

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.900
You walk around like big shots,

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:40.170
but you're all protected
by your fathers' names.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.400
You've never worked
for your money.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.200
So quit mouthing off!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.550
<i>Uh-oh...</i>

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:12.760
<i>I'm the one who wanted peace...</i>

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:17.570
<i>That's right. I was going
 to keep a low profile...</i>

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:28.280
Take a look at this, Tsukushi.
It's a big fad at our school.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:29.750
You do this...

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.520
It checks your emotions.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:38.190
What's wrong, Tsukushi?
Did something happen?

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:46.160
Hmm... That's so you, Tsukushi.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.170
I wish I hadn't done it.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:51.400
I was doing my best
not to stand out.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.570
You were never so timid

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.010
when you were in
junior high school.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:06.580
You were always ready to jump in
and help when there was trouble.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:09.750
<i>That's right...</i>

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:14.730
<i>It was people like me now
that I hated the most.</i>

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:19.760
<i>I've closed my eyes to so many things
in order to protect myself.</i>

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.640
But those F4 sound so awful.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.810
That Tsukasa, the leader,
is the worst.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:31.710
I heard Eitoku Academy is filled
with upper-class kids.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:33.950
Average kids would love to be them.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:38.050
My entering Eitoku was
my first mistake.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:43.390
Why are they called the F4?

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.820
It's so ridiculous.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:50.300
They're the Flower Four... F4.
Isn't it silly?

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:54.330
I guess they're as pretty as
flowers and they're rich.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.170
They may look good,

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.870
but inside they're
dirtier than manure.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.770
Sticky and slimy!

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:02.370
Disgusting!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:05.580
Are you sure all four of them are
nasty like that?

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:06.980
Well...

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.790
Actually, there is one...

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.760
I'm imagining things!

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:22.990
Tsukushi, I'm giving you this,
so please cheer up.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.400
Yuki...

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:27.670
Uh-oh, we're going to be
late for work.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:29.870
- Yikes!
- We'd better hurry!

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:30.570
Yeah!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.160
<i>A red slip...</i>

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.170
<i>A declaration of war from the F4.</i>

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.440
Makiko...

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:24.220
That's the way it goes
with cheap friendships.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:04.730
This is not a school for
ordinary people, you know...

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.160
Hurry up and leave!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.470
Go back to your...

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:17.580
Good morning!

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.880
Take your seats.
Class is about to begin.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.750
What's the matter, Miss Makino?
Take your seat.

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.560
My desk is gone...

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.560
Have the administrative 
office order one.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.900
Now, open your books
to page 26...

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:39.960
Tattling won't get you anywhere...

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:42.070
You asked for it.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.000
Poor thing...

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.640
<i>I'm not going to cry. Not here.</i>

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:08.560
<i>I'm not going to cry.
Not in front of those fools.</i>

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.900
<i>This is all because of
those cruel, infantile F4!</i>

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:27.850
You big, stupid jerks! I hope you all
eat yourselves to death!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.650
I can't stand this...

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.050
You've got something
in your hair.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.020
Huh?

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:39.890
<i>Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.930
What is that? Raw egg?

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.530
Did you use an egg yolk to condition
your hair this morning?

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:49.570
Don't be stupid!
My classmates threw eggs at me...

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.140
Thanks to you four.

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:54.670
Well? Are you satisfied?

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:59.280
You're funny.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.580
What's so funny?

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:10.620
<i>What's with this guy?
He's a member of the F4.</i>

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:16.160
<i>I don't really care, but
why is he talking to me?</i>

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.730
<i>Looking at him like this,</i>

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.630
<i>he really does have classic features.</i>

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:25.570
<i>Wow! His eyelashes are so long...</i>

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:35.480
What are the F4 like?
You seem a little different.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:40.020
It's no use. You won't get
anything out of me.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:44.490
Don't you think you'd be better
off leaving this school?

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:49.130
You four have driven out lots
of students from this school this way, right?

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:53.300
I never wanted to come
to this school.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.570
But my family
had their reasons...

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.000
So what? I don't care...

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:03.140
I have no interest...
in other people.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.420
<i>How can he talk that way?</i>

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:16.790
<i>I actually thought he was nice...
How stupid of me!</i>

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:26.760
I... uh... It was Phys Ed class
and... nobody was around...

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.970
I found it by the
incinerator out back.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:33.670
<i>My desk...</i>

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.810
<i>She sneaked it here
all by herself... without anybody knowing...</i>

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:43.950
I... I... Tsukushi, I...

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:48.790
Go, Makiko. You'll get into
trouble if they see you with me.

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:50.590
Tsukushi...

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:54.460
Don't worry. I'm like a weed.
Very tough.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.550
I wonder what this is...

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.360
<i>I'm sorry, Tsukushi.</i>

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:36.000
<i>I like myself a lot better now.
I guess the real me was sleeping.</i>

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.340
<i>There's no turning back.</i>

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.400
<i>You have only yourself
to rely on, Tsukushi!</i>

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.290
What do you want?

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:58.190
We want to help you 
work up the nerve

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.190
to leave this school
as soon as possible.

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:08.030
Don't underestimate me, rich boys.

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:11.440
I won't let people like you
lay a finger on me!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.770
- This should be fun.
- Get her!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.570
<i>This is not funny!</i>

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.520
<i>Ohh... This is so not funny!</i>

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:34.430
Gotcha!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.200
Don't touch me, you jerk!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:42.900
What are you doing?

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.610
Hanazawa...

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.510
<i>I have no interest...
in other people.</i>

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:57.680
<i>I'm finished...</i>

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:00.750
Domyoji asked us to do this.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.120
Let her go.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:03.790
B-But...

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.960
I told you to let her go.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:20.940
Thank you.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.510
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.680
I just don't like
this sort of thing.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:35.150
<i>I can take my desk disappearing,
or eggs thrown at me.</i>

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.490
<i>I can get right back on my feet.</i>

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:40.860
<i>But, I don't know how to
deal with this sort of kindness...</i>

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.000
More!

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.960
Sis, that's your fourth serving.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:48.930
Is your stomach all right?

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:51.270
I need to build up my stamina.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:20:00.280
Don't think I'll fall
for the same trick twice.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.480
Eggs are meant to be eaten,
not thrown.

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:06.750
If you need to throw something,
there's such a thing as a ball.

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:08.720
Right?!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:13.860
Idiots! You asked for it.
That'll teach you not to mess with me again!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.290
It's the F4!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.760
Nishikado's mine!

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:19.900
My favorite, Domyoji!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.880
Here goes...

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.590
Tsukasa Domyoji!

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:58.170
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:04.180
You call yourself a man?
What you're doing is dirty!

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:08.350
I'll pound your twisted attitude
out straight!

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.550
It's a declaration of war!

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:18.990
S-Sis...

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:41.250
<i>I did it! I don't know what
they'll do to me now...</i>

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:44.180
<i>But... But this...</i>

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.520
...feels... so... good!

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:51.160
Yay!

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:11.410
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:19.280
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:29.160
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:37.200
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:44.980
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:53.120
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:53.120
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.120 --> 00:23:01.490
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.120 --> 00:23:01.490
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:11.270
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:19.040
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:27.220
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:35.630
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:35.630
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:56.250
<i>Anyone who thinks he can
have his way in everything</i>

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:59.280
<i>just because his parents are
very powerful, is very wrong.</i>

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:02.050
<i>I will never cater to anyone.</i>

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:05.820
<i>I'll teach him that there are things
you can't buy in this worid.</i>

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:08.690
<i>Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"No Brand Girl!"</i>

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:10.800
<i>I've found something
that money can't buy.</i>
